<title>SPAIN: Popular says open to foreign purchases.</title>
<headline>Popular says open to foreign purchases.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Popular said on Wednesday it remains open to foreign purchases, but at the moment sees nothing attractive in, for example, Latin America.</p>
<p>&quot;We remain open to an operation, say for example, in Latin America, if it is attractive,&quot; technical director Manuel Martin told jounalists at a news conference on first-quarter earnings.</p>
<p>&quot;(But at the moment) we believe its is not attractive,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
